sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant EntryPoint
  participant CrashDetector
  participant Swing
  participant RendererNativeLibraryLoader
  participant StageIDE
  participant IDE
  participant DocumentFrame

  User->>EntryPoint: launch(args)
  EntryPoint->>CrashDetector: open/check previous close
  EntryPoint->>EntryPoint: register FlatLaf and parse args
  EntryPoint->>RendererNativeLibraryLoader: initializeIfNecessary()
  EntryPoint->>Swing: invokeLater(start UI)
  Swing->>EntryPoint: loadClassInfos()
  Swing->>StageIDE: new StageIDE(crashDetector)
  StageIDE->>IDE: constructor and locale setup
  Swing->>StageIDE: initialize(args)
  StageIDE->>IDE: initialize(args)
  IDE->>DocumentFrame: initialize()
  Swing->>DocumentFrame: show frame

